# 5. PROMO CAROUSEL

Place a large landscape promotional banner at the top of the used cars page.

Requirements:

- Wide landscape image.
- Rounded corners (16–22 px radius).
- Consistent side margins.
- Appropriate image fitting (cover/contain).
- No stretching.
- Adequate vertical spacing below (28–40 px).

Use an existing suitable asset. If none exists, use a clearly identified placeholder rather than an unrelated or misleading image.

