# 6. "FIND SECOND HAND CARS" CARD

Display a white rounded card with border below the promo carousel.

Layout:

- Padding: significant horizontal padding.
- Background: white surface.
- Border: thin gray divider border.
- Corner radius: 16–22 px.
- Box shadow: subtle, offset (0, 4), blur 12.

Inside the card:

- Heading: "Find Second Hand Cars" (titleLarge, semibold, primary text color).
- Subheading or description text (bodyMedium, secondary text color).
- Location search field (see Section 7).
- Two action buttons: "Sell Your Car" and "Check Value of Your Car" (horizontal row, divided by a thin divider).

