# 7. LOCATION SEARCH FIELD

Display a wide search field below the "Find Second Hand Cars" card.

Layout:

- Height: 52 px.
- White background.
- Thin gray border, rounded corners (26 px radius).
- Left: location icon (20 px).
- Left padding: comfortable horizontal spacing.
- Center: text "View Used cars in [City]" (bodyMedium, semibold, secondary text).
- Right: forward arrow icon inside circular teal button (20 px).

Tapping the search field or the forward arrow should navigate to the search cars route (`/search-cars`) or keep the navigation consistent with existing behavior.

