# 9. "FIND THE CARS OF YOUR CHOICE" FILTER SECTION

Display a section titled "Find The Cars Of Your Choice".

Layout:

- Section title (titleMedium, semibold, secondary text color).
- Standard gap below title (16 px).
- Filter category tabs: Budget, Body Type, Fuel Type, Transmission.
- Each tab: outline icon, teal selection/underline when active, dark gray when inactive.
- Tabs are horizontally scrollable if needed.

## 9.1 Filter tabs detail

### Budget

- Initially display price ranges (ETB).
- Two-column grid of price range chips: 1M–1.5M, 1.5M–2M, 2M–3M, 3M+.
- Each chip: pale teal background, rounded corners, thin border, icon (payments), label.
- "Luxury Cars" row at the bottom: teal outlined chip with chevron, tapping opens luxury brand list.

### Body Type

- Initially select "SUV/MUV".
- Horizontally scrollable chips: SUV/MUV, Hatchback, Sedan.

### Fuel Type

- Initially display supported fuel types.
- Horizontally scrollable chips with icons: Petrol, Diesel, CNG, Electric, LPG, Hybrid.
- Each chip uses appropriate icon (local_gas_station, oil_barrel, compress, electric_car, propane_tank, eco).

### Transmission

- Horizontally scrollable chips: Automatic, Manual, Clutchless Manual.
- Each chip uses appropriate icon (settings, settings_input_hdmi, swap_horiz).

Filter behavior:

- Selecting a chip/filter updates the vehicle list below.
- Switching tabs updates available chips.
- Reuse existing filter state and models.

