# 11. "WANT TO SELL YOUR CAR?" BANNER

Display a white rounded card with title, description, feature grid, and teal outlined "Sell Your Car" button.

Layout:

- Significant top padding (xl).
- White surface, thin gray border, rounded corners (Lg radius).
- Maximum width: full screen, appropriate horizontal padding.

Inside the card:

- Heading: "Want to Sell Your Car ?" (titleLarge, semibold, primary text).
- Description paragraph: "Over 2.5 million used car buyers visit our site every month looking for a used car!" (bodyMedium, secondary text, height 1.4).
- Feature grid: 2×2 grid of feature items (lg horizontal gap, lg vertical gap between rows).
- Each feature: small teal circular icon (38 px) + label text (bodySmall, primary text, height 1.2).

Feature items (preserve existing):

1. Sell within days (calendar_today_outlined).
2. Best price deal (payments_outlined).
3. Verified buyers (verified_user_outlined).
4. 90 days ad validity (schedule).

- Below the feature grid: significant gap (lg).
- Full-width outlined teal button: "Sell Your Car" (buttonHeight, teal border, teal text, rounded corners).

On tap: navigate to sell car route (`/sell-car`).

