# 12. "Tools You May Need" SECTION

Display a section titled "Tools You May Need".

Layout:

- Significant top padding (xl).
- Section title (titleMedium, semibold, secondary text color).
- Standard gap below title (16 px).
- White rounded container with thin gray border and rounded corners (Lg radius).
- Inside container: two horizontal tool items separated by a thin divider.

## 12.1 Tool items (horizontal row)

Each tool item contains:

- Light teal circular icon (52×52 px) on the left.
- Bold title (titleSmall, fontWeight 400, primary text).
- Small gap (md).
- Description text (bodySmall, secondary text, height 1.35, wrapped).
- Right chevron icon (20 px, secondary text).

Tool 1: "Used Car Valuation"
- Icon: confirmation_number_outlined.
- Description: "Check the price of a used car with our calculator".

On tap: navigate to car valuation route (`/check-car-valuation`).

Tool 2: "Instant Car Loan"
- Icon: attach_money.
- Description: "Apply and get the best Car Loan Offers within minutes".

On tap: navigate to car loan route (`/loan`).

