# 13. PRICE DISCLAIMER

Display an appropriate disclaimer near the relevant car catalog sections.

Recommended wording:

"Prices are indicative and may vary by location and dealer."

Use a more specific on-road price disclaimer only when supported by the underlying data.

Do not use Indian locations, INR, or Indian lakh-based pricing.

Place the disclaimer below the filtered car list, below the popular cars section, or at the bottom of the page in a subtle font.

