Implement and verify the page in this order:

1. Header, top action bar, and location chip.
2. Promo carousel.
3. "Find Second Hand Cars" card + location search field.
4. "Used Cars By City" section + city grid + Other Cities tile.
5. "Find The Cars Of Your Choice" filter section with all four tabs.
6. "Popular Pre Owned Cars" section with tab bar, models grid, brands grid, View All button.
7. "Want to Sell Your Car?" banner + description + feature grid + Sell button.
8. "Tools You May Need" section with car valuation + car loan tools.
9. Price disclaimer placement.
10. Bottom navigation verification.

Do not attempt to implement all ten stages in one operation. Complete each stage and review it before continuing.

