## Layout

- Header and search are correctly aligned.
- Location chip has correct icon, border, and notification dot.
- Promo carousel has correct proportions and rounded corners.
- "Find Second Hand Cars" card has correct border, shadow, and action buttons.
- Location search field has correct height, border, and placeholder text.
- City grid has exactly 3 columns with dividers.
- "Other Cities" tile is present and styled.
- Filter tabs (Budget, Body Type, Fuel Type, Transmission) are in correct order.
- Filter chips within each tab have correct icons and styling.
- Popular models car cards have correct width, image height, and price format.
- Brands grid has 3-column layout with monogram logos.
- "View All Used Cars" button is present and styled.
- "Want to Sell Your Car?" banner has correct description and 2×2 feature grid.
- Feature items have correct icon + label layout.
- "Sell Your Car" button at bottom of banner is present and styled.
- "Tools You May Need" section has correct title, gap, and two tool items.
- Tool items have correct icons, titles, descriptions, and chevrons.
- Price disclaimer is present with recommended wording.
- Bottom navigation has 5 items with "Used" selected.

## Functionality

- Location chip navigates to location route.
- Search field / forward arrow navigates to search cars.
- City tiles navigate or show interaction.
- "Other Cities" tile has documented missing integration if not implemented.
- Filter tabs switch and update content when supported.
- Budget price ranges update filtered list.
- Body type/fuel type/transmission chips update results.
- Popular models/brands tab bar switches correctly.
- Car card tapping opens vehicle details page.
- "View All Used Cars" navigates to used cars catalog.
- "Sell Your Car" banner button navigates to sell car route.
- Used car valuation tool navigates to check car valuation.
- Instant car loan tool navigates to car loan route.
- Bottom navigation remains functional across all pages.

## Quality

- Ethiopian-market content and ETB pricing are used where available.
- Sample data and missing integrations are clearly documented.
- Existing correct code has been preserved.
- Unnecessary code has been removed only after verification.
- No new overflow or runtime errors have been introduced.
- Flutter analysis has been run (no errors or warnings).
- Relevant tests have been run.
- Pre-existing errors are distinguished from new errors.

