## Key Reuse Patterns (per used.doc)

### 1. Comparison & Navigation Integration
- **Bottom navigation**: Reuse existing 5-item nav (New, **Used**, Compare, News, Alerts)
- **Do NOT**: Add second navigation bar inside Used Cars page
- **Route navigation**: Use existing routes from `app_routes.dart`:
  - `/location` for location chip
  - `/search-cars` for search field
  - `/explore-used-cars` for "View All Used Cars" button
  - `/sell-car` for "Sell Your Car" banner button
  - `/check-car-valuation` for valuation tool
  - `/loan` for instant car loan tool

### 2. Brand Logos & Logos
- **Reuse**: `shared/common/brand_logos.dart` with `SimpleIcons` package
- **Fallback**: First-letter initial when logo unavailable (used in brands grid)
- **Brand grid**: 3-column layout per §10.3 specification

### 3. Car Images & Specifications
- **Reuse**: `shared/widgets/app_car_image.dart` with error fallbacks
- **Spec chips**: Reuse pattern from `car_details_screen.dart`'s `_SpecChip` for year/body/fuel/transmission/km
- **Price format**: ETB with thousands separator + "ETB" suffix (from `filter_results.Car.priceText`)
- **Do NOT**: Use Indian rupees or lakh notation

### 4. Filter Results
- **Reuse**: `shared/common/filter_results/filter_results.dart`'s `Car` model and `FilteredResultsScreen`
- **Filter chips**: Budget price ranges, Body Type (SUV/MUV, Hatchback, Sedan), Fuel Type (Petrol, Diesel, CNG, Electric, LPG, Hybrid), Transmission (Automatic, Manual, Clutchless Manual)
- **Do NOT**: Duplicate filtering logic - reuse existing filter state and models

### 5. Bottom Navigation (§14)
- **Reuse**: Existing 5-item bottom nav (New, **Used**, Compare, News, Alerts)
- **Selected state**: Teal for **Used** when on Used Cars page
- **Do NOT**: Add second navigation bar inside Used Cars page

### 6. Color & Theme Integration
- **Reuse**: Existing `app_colors.dart` palette (with used.doc §3.1 colors as starting values)
- **Teal**: `#217F78` for selected states
- **Pale teal**: `#EAF7F5` for icon backgrounds
- **Outlined action**: `#287B99` for "Sell Your Car" button
- **Red notification**: `#FF0000` for location/badge dot

### 7. Promo Carousel (§5)
- **Reuse**: `shared/widgets/promo_carousel.dart` for promotional banner
- **Images**: Existing assets or clearly identified placeholders

### 8. Icon Library
- **Reuse**: `core/constants/app_icons.dart` with `LucideIcons` package
- **Specific icons used**:
  - `locationCity` for location chip
  - `filter` for filter tabs
  - `payments` for budget/price chips
  - `local_gas_station`, `oil_barrel`, `electric_car` for fuel type
  - `settings`, `settings_input_hdmi`, `swap_horiz` for transmission
  - `calendar_today_outlined`, `payments_outlined`, `verified_user_outlined`, `schedule` for sell banner features
  - `confirmation_number_outlined` for valuation tool
  - `attach_money` for loan tool

## Implementation Principles

| Principle | Description |
|-----------|-------------|
| **Heavy Reuse** | ~80% of code from existing features (compare, news, new cars) |
| **Incremental** | Implement sections per order in §18 (10 stages) |
| **ETB Pricing** | All prices in Ethiopian Birr, no INR/lakh notation |
| **Sample Data** | Clearly identify missing integrations vs. real data |
| **Safe Modification** | Inspect before editing per §17 rules |
| **Preserve Functionality** | Keep New Cars, Compare, News, Alerts intact |
| **Bottom Nav** | Single 5-item nav only, "Used" selected when on this page |

## Development Workflow

1. **Start with `used.dart`** as the public entry point
2. **Create `used_impl.dart`** with all section widgets
3. **Implement incrementally** following §18 order (10 stages)
4. **Reuse existing widgets** where patterns match (especially from new, compare, news)
5. **Document missing integrations** clearly rather than pretending
6. **Run Flutter analysis** after each stage (quality checks §19)
7. **Verify bottom navigation** remains functional (5 items, "Used" selected)

## What NOT to Do

❌ Don't create duplicate filtering engine - reuse `filter_results.dart`
❌ Don't invent new news database - reuse `news.dart` patterns
❌ Don't rewrite entire page unnecessarily - follow incremental plan
❌ Don't use Indian pricing - ETB only, "Contact for price" where needed
❌ Don't add second bottom navigation - reuse existing 5-item nav
❌ Don't claim integrations work unless verified - document limitations
❌ Don't change bottom nav selection - "Used" must remain selected on this page

⚠️ **Critical**: The bottom navigation must preserve "Used" as the selected item when on the Used Cars page. Do not toggle or change this state.

This section serves as a guide for the development team to organize code consistently with the project's existing patterns and the `used.doc` specification.